  "labelled_by": "read by hand: every Drizzle table access in six model files of packages/database (src/models/apiKey.ts, aiProvider.ts, asyncTask.ts, chunk.ts, session.ts, thread.ts). Their tables are declared with pgTable across about 120 files under src/schemas and imported through the schemas index. An access is labelled on the line where the table is passed: select().from(t) and the join methods (innerJoin, leftJoin and the like) are READS of t, including a select used as a subquery; insert(t), update(t) and delete(t) are WRITES of t only; db.query.t.findFirst/findMany (the relational API, on db or a transaction) is READS of t on the line naming t. Column references (t.id) and sql`` fragments that name no other table are not accesses. These files use no relational with: clauses. Array.from calls are not accesses. The labels are a sample of the package, so other lines are not counted.",
